This photo shows the leftovers of a finished meal. Only small residues remain: a few crumbs and yellow egg or sauce smears on the left plate, and green herb or sauce traces on the right plate. The mug also holds a coffee-foam residue, which I'm not counting as food.

Rough estimate of what is left on the plates: about 10 g in total, at around 1.5 kcal/g, which comes to about 15 kcal.

